About Us：
We are building an AI-native platform that helps global digital businesses make better growth decisions.
Today, companies spend millions of dollars across fragmented advertising ecosystems, including Meta, Google, TikTok, AppLovin, DSPs, and other channels.
However, growth teams still struggle with:
Understanding which channels truly drive high-value users;
Identifying why performance changes;
Measuring real user quality and long-term business value;
Turning fragmented data into actionable decisions.
Our platform combines:
Advertising data;
Business performance data;
Market intelligence;
AI agents;
Expert workflows;
to build the next generation of growth intelligence infrastructure.
The Opportunity：
We are looking for a Founding Engineer
to join at the earliest stage and help build the product from 0 to 1.
This is not a traditional engineering role.
You will work directly with the Founder to define:
Product architecture;
Technical roadmap;
AI application strategy;
Data infrastructure.
You will have significant ownership in shaping the first product and engineering foundation.
What You Will Build：
Growth Intelligence Platform
Build systems that help companies:
Connect advertising and business data;
Analyze performance;
Understand user quality;
Identify growth opportunities;
Generate AI-powered recommendations.
